          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does induction mode work, and does it need pairing?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No pairing. Play anything on your phone, then rest the phone on the stand with its speaker facing the pad. Perch picks up the sound through induction and plays it through its own driver. It works with any phone that has a speaker, with no app and no Bluetooth. For a tablet or a laptop, or when you want to keep the phone in your hand, use Bluetooth instead.</p>",
