          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does the battery last?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The battery is 1500 mAh. How long that lasts depends on volume and on whether the light is on, so we would rather not quote a single number. An evening of film at normal volume is comfortably within range. It charges over USB with the cable in the box, and it works while plugged in.</p>",
            "page": ""
